308
00:24:08.480 --> 00:24:10.560
Ma sain oma asjad korda.

309
00:24:10.660 --> 00:24:12.900
Olen jälle tagasi sadulas.

310
00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:14.259
Nojah,

311
00:24:14.359 --> 00:24:17.460
